# Abzan Charm's third mode: "Distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two
# target creatures" (a Charm mode with DividedAsYouChoose$ 2). No creature
# has power 3 or greater, so the exile mode cannot be chosen and the modes
# offered are draw (0) and counters (1). One target takes the whole amount
# without a division being asked (PlayerControllerHuman.java:2495-2496).
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 5 W
tapformana ai 6 B
tapformana ai 7 G
queue modechoice 1
queue targets 1
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
